WEBVTT

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.697
"Really, am I responsible? Is this fair?

00:03:01.197 --> 00:03:07.563
How would I advise a close friend
who were in a similar situation?"

00:03:08.263 --> 00:03:11.730
No, that's not your responsibility.

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:16.330
There's not a good reason for feeling
that guilt, and it's not helpful.

00:03:17.363 --> 00:03:20.663
[How can you support someone
who's struggling with shame?]

00:03:21.097 --> 00:03:23.430
I think if it's an ongoing sort of issue,

00:03:23.463 --> 00:03:25.663
that therapy is certainly an option,

00:03:25.697 --> 00:03:28.563
and I think there are many therapists
who work with that

00:03:28.597 --> 00:03:33.497
and help people move away from
problematic feelings of shame